PhotoCraft for HarmonyOS (照片工坊)
Copyright 2026 PhotoCraft for HarmonyOS contributors

This is an unofficial, non-commercial HarmonyOS client that wraps the
WebAssembly build of the upstream PhotoCraft editor. It is NOT maintained by,
affiliated with, or endorsed by the upstream project or ArtCraft.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Upstream software
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
This product contains a WebAssembly engine built from the source of:

    PhotoCraft — https://github.com/storytold/photocraft
    Copyright Storytold / ArtCraft
    Licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0 (dual license), at the licensee's option.

The engine binaries shipped under
`entry/src/main/resources/rawfile/photocraft/` were compiled from that source.
The complete set of local modifications is kept as patch files under
`tools/build_engine_zh/`:

  - engine-zh.patch    default UI language -> zh-hans; bundle a subsetted
                       CJK font; append the font to the egui font fallback
                       chain.
  - mip-gl-fix.patch   (superseded by view-cache.patch) GL mip generation
                       read/write feedback loop.
  - view-cache.patch   remove the document mip chain entirely; add a
                       screen-sized offscreen ViewCache; blit once per frame.
  - navigator.patch    stop the navigator thumbnail from re-reducing the whole
                       document every frame while a stroke is in progress.

