2. Bundled font
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Noto Sans SC is used in subsetted form (549 KB / 2348 glyphs, weight 400).

    Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors (https://github.com/notofonts/notofonts)
    Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
    Full license text: tools/build_engine_zh/fonts/LICENSE-NotoSansSC.txt

NOTE / TODO: the OFL's Reserved Font Name clause means a *modified* (here:
subsetted) version should not be distributed under the name "Noto Sans SC"
without the copyright holder's permission. The engine currently still
registers it under that name. Rename it (e.g. to "PhotoCraft Sans SC") before
publishing a binary release. See README §"许可与署名".

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. Third-party Rust crates inside the .wasm
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The compiled engine statically links a large dependency tree (wgpu, egui,
naga, image codecs, ...). All of them are permissively licensed (MIT,
Apache-2.0, BSD, Zlib, OFL); no GPL/AGPL code is included.

An exhaustive, machine-generated list cannot live in this repository because
the upstream Cargo workspace is not vendored here. To regenerate it, run on a
machine that has the upstream source checked out:

    cargo about generate --output-file THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md

and place the result next to this file before publishing a release.
